      "col1": {
        "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
        "sling:resourceType": "wcm/foundation/components/parsys",
        "standaloneimage": {
          "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
          "jcr:createdBy": "lee.fuller1@stryker.com",
          "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "kourtney.hatcher@stryker.com",
          "preset": "max_width_1440",
          "jcr:created": "Wed Aug 26 2020 04:48:14 GMT+0000",
          "alt": "Surgical light handle, OR light handle, surgical light, OR light, operating room lights",
          "srcFileRef": "/content/dam/stryker/communications/products/slx-surgical-light/images/SYKC.Stryker.com.Products.SLX_R2-ASSETSPic1.jpg",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Thu Sep 19 2024 13:08:14 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/standaloneimage",
          "enableBorder": "false"
        },
        "text": {
          "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
          "jcr:createdBy": "lee.fuller1@stryker.com",
          "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "cedu.ocson@stryker.com",
          "jcr:created": "Wed Aug 26 2020 04:48:34 GMT+0000",
          "text": "<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\"><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span style=\"color: #ffb500;\">Customizable and ready for the future</span></span></span></p>\n<p>With optional features like touch wall control, HD in-light cameras, and the EndoLite feature, you can customize the surgical lighting in your OR. The SLX628 Surgical Light is built on a suspension that will support you through future surgical light head innovation. With Stryker, you can feel confident in your light platform investment.&nbsp;</p>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Wed Apr 05 2023 22:05:22 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
          "textIsRich": "true"
        }
      },
      "col2": {
        "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
        "sling:resourceType": "wcm/foundation/components/parsys",
        "standaloneimage": {
          "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
          "jcr:createdBy": "lee.fuller1@stryker.com",
          "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "kourtney.hatcher@stryker.com",
          "preset": "max_width_1440",
          "jcr:created": "Wed Aug 26 2020 04:48:17 GMT+0000",
          "alt": "Doctor holding OR light, Nurse OR light, Surgeon OR light, Surgeon surgical lights, surgical lights",
          "srcFileRef": "/content/dam/stryker/communications/products/slx-surgical-light/images/SYKC.Stryker.com.Products.SLX_R2-ASSETSPic2.jpg",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Thu Sep 19 2024 13:10:03 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/standaloneimage",
          "enableBorder": "false"
        },
        "text_copy": {
          "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
          "jcr:createdBy": "lee.fuller1@stryker.com",
          "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "lee.fuller1@stryker.com",
          "jcr:created": "Wed Aug 26 2020 04:48:34 GMT+0000",
          "text": "<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\"><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span style=\"color: #ffb500;\">Engineered to&nbsp;<br>\n improve visibility</span></span></span></p>\n<p>Harnessing the power of Precision Beam Technology, the&nbsp;SLX628 Surgical Light produces 650 overlapping beams of light to deliver a continuous column of light, minimizing shadows on the surgical field.&nbsp;<br>\n</p>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Wed Sep 16 2020 00:31:40 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
          "textIsRich": "true"
        }
      },
      "col3": {
        "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
        "sling:resourceType": "wcm/foundation/components/parsys",
        "standaloneimage": {
          "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
          "jcr:createdBy": "lee.fuller1@stryker.com",
          "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "kourtney.hatcher@stryker.com",
          "preset": "max_width_1440",
          "jcr:created": "Wed Aug 26 2020 04:48:20 GMT+0000",
          "alt": "Nurse OR light, Nurse surgical light, OR Light on table, OR surgical light, nurse touching surgical light",
          "srcFileRef": "/content/dam/stryker/communications/products/slx-surgical-light/images/SYKC.Stryker.com.Products.SLX_R2-ASSETSPic3.jpg",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Thu Sep 19 2024 13:08:19 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/standaloneimage",
          "enableBorder": "false"
        },
        "text_copy": {
          "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
          "jcr:createdBy": "lee.fuller1@stryker.com",
          "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "lee.fuller1@stryker.com",
          "jcr:created": "Wed Aug 26 2020 04:48:34 GMT+0000",
          "text": "<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\"><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span style=\"color: #ffb500;\">Compatible with<br>\nSterile Control +</span></span></span></p>\n<p>Put more control in your surgeon's hands with Sterile Control +. Customize your light handle to allow for sterile control of four functions. Options include: brightness, spot size, power, color temperature or EndoLite.&nbsp;<br>\n</p>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Wed Aug 26 2020 04:50:42 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
          "textIsRich": "true"
        }
      }
    },
